  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 19685,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "The initial report outlined being able to add any email to a Tumblr account without verifying it first which is expected behavior that does not pose a security risk. However, the reporter also reported that these unverified emails were able to be used in our “follow by email” feature which we did consider to be a security risk. Our fix was to disallow follow by email for unverified emails.",
